Acceptance Criteria

* SmartPay production deployment scripts are committed to the GitLab repository and approved through the standard code review process.
* All deployment scripts execute successfully in the Production environment without errors.
* SmartPay objects (DDL, Stored Procedure, Task and supporting objects) are successfully deployed and available in Production.
* SmartPay scheduled task is created, enabled and executes successfully according to the configured schedule.
* SmartPay data is successfully loaded into the production target tables.
* Post-deployment validation confirms that the deployed objects produce the expected results.
* No impact is observed on existing BDP production processes or dependent applications.
* Deployment evidence and validation results are documented and attached to the Jira ticket.